{"hash":"866bfff147d4b89cbfa12b1e4ba20cc37ed92c12","author":"Martin","email":"mooseofdoom@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:57:40+02:00","subject":"3.4 evidens: OSCAL-sikkerhedsresultatet erklærer også si-4","signedOff":true,"signedOffBy":["Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"],"files":["README.md","evidence/src/oscal.mjs","evidence/test/oscal.test.mjs"],"body":"3.4 evidens: OSCAL-sikkerhedsresultatet erklærer også si-4\n\nKontrolmappingen (3.2) peger både ra-5 og si-4 på SEC-*-fundene, men\nOSCAL-pakken erklærede kun ra-5 i reviewed-controls. Et drift-værn i\nevidens-emitterens tests udleder de forventede kontroller fra\ncontrol-mapping.json, så pakken og mappingen ikke kan drive fra hinanden.\n\nRettet også README-statuslinjen (viste 'Bølge 0' foran hele 0-4-tabellen)\nog testtallet for evidence-test (4 -> 5).\n\nSigned-off-by: Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"}
{"hash":"94025cc50f67423fc1fd43f933227cc1bde26e8a","author":"Martin","email":"mooseofdoom@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:51:59+02:00","subject":"4.3 pitch: deck og LinkedIn med efterprøvede beviser","signedOff":true,"signedOffBy":["Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"],"files":[".github/workflows/ci.yml","Makefile","README.md","docs/pitch/README.md","docs/pitch/deck.md","docs/pitch/linkedin.md","pitch/package.json","pitch/src/check.mjs","pitch/src/cli.mjs","pitch/test/check.test.mjs"],"body":"4.3 pitch: deck og LinkedIn med efterprøvede beviser\n\nPitch-decket bygger på én fungerende adapter og kørende konformanstest.\nHver slide har en Bevis-linje, og make pitch-check efterprøver at hvert\nmake-mål og hver sti faktisk findes.\n\n- docs/pitch/deck.md (14 slides) og docs/pitch/linkedin.md\n- docs/pitch/README.md med fem-minutters reproduktion\n- pitch/ checker + 4 tests\n- make pitch-check / pitch-test, med i CI\n\nDermed kan decket ikke love noget, repoet ikke kan vise.\n\nSigned-off-by: Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"}
{"hash":"692a0b35770f0dca013dd4a7ca9a839ff26a5f3f","author":"Martin","email":"mooseofdoom@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:50:03+02:00","subject":"4.2 IAM-adapter: Keycloak/Authentik med ærligt partial subject.erase","signedOff":true,"signedOffBy":["Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"],"files":[".github/workflows/ci.yml","Makefile","README.md","docs/spec/README.md","docs/spec/iam-adapter.md","gitops/apps/keycloak-adapter-application.json","gitops/manifests/dev/keycloak-adapter-deployment.json","gitops/manifests/dev/keycloak-adapter-service.json","gitops/manifests/dev/keycloak-adapter-serviceaccount.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-grafana-dashboards.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-prometheus-rules.json","modules/keycloak-adapter/conformance/events/agent-action.json","modules/keycloak-adapter/conformance/events/human-action.json","modules/keycloak-adapter/conformance/evidence/health.json","modules/keycloak-adapter/conformance/evidence/policy-decision.json","modules/keycloak-adapter/conformance/evidence/subject.export.json","modules/keycloak-adapter/conformance/evidence/subject.locate.json","modules/keycloak-adapter/module-manifest.json","modules/keycloak-adapter/service/package.json","modules/keycloak-adapter/service/src/auth.mjs","modules/keycloak-adapter/service/src/cli.mjs","modules/keycloak-adapter/service/src/evidence.mjs","modules/keycloak-adapter/service/src/keycloak.mjs","modules/keycloak-adapter/service/src/mock-keycloak.mjs","modules/keycloak-adapter/service/src/pdp-client.mjs","modules/keycloak-adapter/service/src/server.mjs","modules/keycloak-adapter/service/test/adapter.test.mjs","observability/test/dashboard.test.mjs"],"body":"4.2 IAM-adapter: Keycloak/Authentik med ærligt partial subject.erase\n\nFørste nye adapter i backloggens rækkefølge. Wrapper upstream uændret og\noversætter privacy-verberne gennem Keycloak Admin API.\n\n- modules/keycloak-adapter med manifest, server, klient, mock og tests\n- locate/export/health er full; erase er partial fordi event-store, backups\n  og cachede tokens ikke fjernes af Admin API'et\n- 7 adaptertests og 12 konformanstjek grønne\n- GitOps: Application, Deployment, Service og ServiceAccount\n- make iam-adapter-test / iam-adapter-evidence, med i CI\n- docs/spec/iam-adapter.md\n\nTilføjelsen af modulets SLO opdaterer også de genererede observability-\ndashboards, hvilket make observability-check fanger.\n\nSigned-off-by: Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"}
{"hash":"d717eee4aaf0e91cba6d6ab2189cf3b914a62633","author":"Martin","email":"mooseofdoom@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:46:20+02:00","subject":"4.1 ejer-curriculum: scenarier bygget på rigtige approval-payloads","signedOff":true,"signedOffBy":["Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"],"files":[".github/workflows/ci.yml","Makefile","README.md","compliance/control-mapping.json","conformance/src/schemas.mjs","conformance/src/validate-schemas.mjs","contracts/curriculum.schema.json","contracts/examples/curriculum.example.json","curriculum/curriculum.json","curriculum/package.json","curriculum/src/cli.mjs","curriculum/src/curriculum.mjs","curriculum/test/curriculum.test.mjs","docs/adr/0012-ejer-curriculum.md","docs/adr/README.md","docs/compliance/mapping.md","docs/spec/README.md","docs/spec/curriculum.md"],"body":"4.1 ejer-curriculum: scenarier bygget på rigtige approval-payloads\n\nEjer-curriculum med fem emner og forslag, der deterministisk skal afvises.\nGennemførelse logges som CloudEvent og håndhæves af approval-servicen.\n\n- kontrakt contracts/curriculum.schema.json med eksempel\n- curriculum/ med base-payload + sti-overrides + rejectionCriteria\n- 8 scenarier, heraf 7 must-reject (juridisk ansvar, evidens, afvisning,\n  kill switch, første 24 timer)\n- complete() udsender dk.platform.curriculum.module.completed CloudEvents\n- trainingRegistryFromEvents kobler gennemførelser til 2.4 (HTTP 428)\n- kontrolmappingen fører at-2 mod NIS2 art. 21(2)g og AI Act art. 4\n- make curriculum-check / curriculum-render / curriculum-test, med i CI\n- docs/spec/curriculum.md og ADR-0012\n\nEt approve-scenarie må ikke opfylde et afvisningskriterium, og påstande\nder ikke matcher evidensen gør scenariet til et reject.\n\nSigned-off-by: Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"}
{"hash":"00510742b9a6f78614ff8e4bb92a39680344a242","author":"Martin","email":"mooseofdoom@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:42:32+02:00","subject":"3.4 sikkerhedsplan: Trivy/Falco/Wazuh koblet ind i evidensplanen","signedOff":true,"signedOffBy":["Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"],"files":[".github/workflows/ci.yml","Makefile","README.md","compliance/control-mapping.json","conformance/src/schemas.mjs","conformance/src/validate-schemas.mjs","contracts/examples/security-findings.example.json","contracts/security-findings.schema.json","docs/adr/0011-sikkerhedsfund-i-evidensplanen.md","docs/adr/README.md","docs/compliance/mapping.md","docs/spec/README.md","docs/spec/security-plan.md","evidence/src/collect.mjs","evidence/src/oscal.mjs","evidence/test/oscal.test.mjs","security/falco/platform-rules.yaml","security/generated/security-findings.json","security/package.json","security/raw/README.md","security/raw/falco-events.json","security/raw/trivy-app.json","security/raw/wazuh-alerts.json","security/src/cli.mjs","security/src/ingest.mjs","security/src/normalize.mjs","security/test/normalize.test.mjs","security/wazuh/local_rules.xml"],"body":"3.4 sikkerhedsplan: Trivy/Falco/Wazuh koblet ind i evidensplanen\n\nNormaliserer Trivy (CI), Falco (runtime) og Wazuh (SIEM) til én kontrakt og\nlader OSCAL-emitteren bære fundene som observationer og SEC-* findings.\n\n- kontrakt contracts/security-findings.schema.json med eksempel\n- security/ normaliserer de tre scannerformater, med konservativ status\n- Falco-regler og Wazuh-regler for platformen\n- Trivy filesystem-scan i CI, rapporten uploades som artefakt\n- OSCAL-pakken får et Sikkerhed-resultat med rårapport + sha256 som evidens\n- kontrolmappingen peger på SEC-trivy/SEC-falco/SEC-wazuh (ra-5, si-4)\n- make security-ingest / security-check / security-test, med i CI\n- docs/spec/security-plan.md og ADR-0011\n\nFund registreres i evidensen frem for at fejle bygget (exit-code 0).\n\nSigned-off-by: Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"}
{"hash":"85be2d0ae4175e20fab22a434c57e290b836a717","author":"Martin","email":"mooseofdoom@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:38:21+02:00","subject":"3.3 ops-dashboards: Prometheus og Grafana genereret fra modulets SLO","signedOff":true,"signedOffBy":["Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"],"files":[".github/workflows/ci.yml","Makefile","README.md","docs/adr/0010-dashboards-fra-manifest.md","docs/adr/README.md","docs/spec/README.md","docs/spec/observability.md","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-grafana-dashboards.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-grafana-deployment.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-grafana-provisioning.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-grafana-service.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-grafana-serviceaccount.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-loki-config.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-loki-deployment.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-loki-service.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-loki-serviceaccount.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-prometheus-config.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-prometheus-deployment.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-prometheus-rules.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-prometheus-service.json","gitops/manifests/dev/observability-prometheus-serviceaccount.json","observability/package.json","observability/src/cli.mjs","observability/src/generate.mjs","observability/test/dashboard.test.mjs"],"body":"3.3 ops-dashboards: Prometheus og Grafana genereret fra modulets SLO\n\nSLO pr. modul udledes af module-manifest.json og bliver til Prometheus-regler\nog Grafana-dashboards. Agenthandlinger er et førsteklasses view.\n\n- nyt observability/-modul uden runtime-afhængigheder (generate + cli)\n- genererede GitOps-ConfigMaps for regler og dashboards\n- modul-SLO-dashboard med tærskler pr. modul + fejlbugdget-reference\n- agent-dashboard: eskalering, budget, gateway-bypass, autonomiklasse og Loki-log\n- Prometheus/Grafana/Loki-stack som hærdede Deployments i gitops\n- make observability-dashboards / observability-check / observability-test, med i CI\n- docs/spec/observability.md og ADR-0010\n\nmake observability-check fejler hvis SLO ændres i manifestet uden at\ndashboardet følger med.\n\nSigned-off-by: Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"}
{"hash":"cab8fc7b389173199c74244348700c8b9936fd3b","author":"Martin","email":"mooseofdoom@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:35:22+02:00","subject":"3.2 kontrolmapping: NIS2, GDPR og AI Act med udgiver/deployer-roller","signedOff":true,"signedOffBy":["Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"],"files":[".github/workflows/ci.yml","Makefile","README.md","compliance/control-mapping.json","compliance/package.json","compliance/src/cli.mjs","compliance/src/render.mjs","compliance/test/render.test.mjs","conformance/src/checks/compliance.mjs","conformance/src/checks/index.mjs","conformance/src/schemas.mjs","conformance/src/validate-schemas.mjs","contracts/control-mapping.schema.json","contracts/examples/control-mapping.example.json","docs/adr/0009-kontrolmapping-roller.md","docs/adr/README.md","docs/compliance/README.md","docs/compliance/mapping.md","docs/spec/README.md","docs/spec/control-mapping.md"],"body":"3.2 kontrolmapping: NIS2, GDPR og AI Act med udgiver/deployer-roller\n\nKortlægger platformens tekniske kontroller mod regulatoriske krav i én\nkanonisk registry og genererer den menneskelæste tabel derfra.\n\n- kontrakt contracts/control-mapping.schema.json med eksempel\n- compliance/control-mapping.json som kanonisk kilde + compliance/src/render.mjs\n- docs/compliance/README.md og genereret docs/compliance/mapping.md\n- konformanstjek C-012: modulets controlRefs skal findes i kortlægningen\n- make compliance-mapping / compliance-check / compliance-test, med i CI\n- docs/spec/control-mapping.md og ADR-0009\n- README siger eksplicit at repoet ikke er 'compliant software'\n\nHvert krav mærkes som issuer (udgiver), deployer eller shared.\n\nSigned-off-by: Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"}
{"hash":"7f19c31145d18a76f9fec5d9cf426d26ddca8f22","author":"Martin","email":"mooseofdoom@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:31:55+02:00","subject":"3.1 OSCAL-evidens-emitter: maskinlæsbar compliance-evidens","signedOff":true,"signedOffBy":["Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"],"files":[".github/workflows/ci.yml","Makefile","README.md","conformance/src/checks/compliance.mjs","conformance/src/checks/index.mjs","conformance/src/schemas.mjs","conformance/src/validate-schemas.mjs","contracts/examples/oscal-assessment-results.example.json","contracts/oscal-assessment-results.schema.json","docs/adr/0008-oscal-evidensprofil.md","docs/adr/README.md","docs/spec/README.md","docs/spec/oscal-evidence.md","evidence/package.json","evidence/src/cli.mjs","evidence/src/collect.mjs","evidence/src/oscal.mjs","evidence/test/oscal.test.mjs"],"body":"3.1 OSCAL-evidens-emitter: maskinlæsbar compliance-evidens\n\nBygger en OSCAL 1.1 assessment-results-profil fra de artefakter platformen\nallerede producerer: konformansrapporten, verbums-beviser, PDP-beslutninger,\naudit-hændelser, git change loggen og GitOps-gate-resultaterne.\n\n- nyt topniveau-modul evidence/ uden runtime-afhængigheder (oscal, collect, cli)\n- kontrakt contracts/oscal-assessment-results.schema.json med eksempel\n- konformanstjek C-011: kontrolpåstande er velformede og dækker persondata\n- make oscal-evidence / make evidence-test, med i make ci og CI-workflowet\n- docs/spec/oscal-evidence.md og ADR-0008\n- retter desuden en YAML-fejl i conformance-jobbet i .github/workflows/ci.yml\n\nskip og fail bliver not-satisfied med begrundelse — ingen grøn vask.\n\nSigned-off-by: Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"}
{"hash":"0b3d7005c25b07fa80c19d186c24532a8b2a5dfe","author":"Martin","email":"mooseofdoom@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:25:13+02:00","subject":"2.7 reviewer-effektmaaling: dashboard for falske negativer og friction","signedOff":true,"signedOffBy":["Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"],"files":[".github/workflows/ci.yml","Makefile","README.md","docs/spec/README.md","docs/spec/reviewer-metrics.md","reviewer/src/metrics-cli.mjs","reviewer/src/metrics.mjs","reviewer/test/metrics.test.mjs"],"body":"2.7 reviewer-effektmaaling: dashboard for falske negativer og friction\n\n- reviewer/src/metrics.mjs: maaler flaggedButApproved (friction) og greenButBroke (falsk negativ)\n- HTTP + dashboard (GET /) der fremhaever falske negativer; 3 tests\n- docs: reviewer-metrics-spec; README + indeks opdateret (boelge 2 komplet)\n\nSigned-off-by: Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"}
{"hash":"c627ecfd2ab6290422bdda9953d2b64d177fe28e","author":"Martin","email":"mooseofdoom@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:24:05+02:00","subject":"2.4+2.5+2.6: approval-service, reviewer-agent og seks agent-konformanstests","signedOff":true,"signedOffBy":["Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"],"files":[".github/workflows/ci.yml","Makefile","README.md","approvals/package.json","approvals/src/approval-service.mjs","approvals/src/claims.mjs","conformance/test/agent-conformance.test.mjs","contracts/approval-request.schema.json","contracts/examples/approval-request.example.json","docs/adr/0007-evidens-og-prosa-adskilt.md","docs/adr/README.md","docs/spec/README.md","docs/spec/agent-conformance.md","docs/spec/approval-service.md","docs/spec/reviewer.md","reviewer/package.json","reviewer/src/reviewer.mjs","runtime/src/injection.mjs","runtime/src/runtime.mjs"],"body":"2.4+2.5+2.6: approval-service, reviewer-agent og seks agent-konformanstests\n\n2.4 approval-service:\n- approvals/: godkendelser, approver-grupper, udloeb, traeningskrav (AI Act art. 4)\n- renderer maskinevidens og agent-prosa visuelt adskilt; viser diff + evidens\n- A3 kan ikke merges uden menneske (merge-check)\n\n2.5 adversarial reviewer:\n- reviewer/: anden leverandoer end forfatteren, ser aendring + raadata\n- kan kun no-objection/flag/reject; autonomiklasse-forsoeg afvises og logges\n\n2.6 agent-konformanstests (seks, alle groenne):\n- forklaring matcher diff (deterministiske claims), A3-menneskekrav,\n  reviewer uden autonomikraft, prompt injection, loop, A4\n\ncontracts: approval-request udvidet med claims + requiredTrainingModules\ndocs: approval-service, reviewer, agent-conformance, ADR-0007\nSigned-off-by: Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"}
{"hash":"96062cdc1e53cdc5e1a1fd6e5a245590d0d4008a","author":"Martin","email":"mooseofdoom@gmail.com","date":"2026-09-16T23:21:46+02:00","subject":"2.2+2.3: AI-gateway og agent-runtime","signedOff":true,"signedOffBy":["Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"],"files":[".github/workflows/ci.yml","Makefile","README.md","conformance/src/checks/agents.mjs","conformance/src/checks/index.mjs","conformance/src/validate-schemas.mjs","contracts/agent-task.schema.json","contracts/examples/agent-task.example.json","contracts/examples/gateway-route.example.json","contracts/gateway-route.schema.json","docs/adr/0006-alle-modelkald-gennem-gateway.md","docs/adr/README.md","docs/spec/README.md","docs/spec/agent-runtime.md","docs/spec/ai-gateway.md","gateway/package.json","gateway/routes.json","gateway/src/cli.mjs","gateway/src/gateway.mjs","gateway/src/provider.mjs","gateway/test/gateway.test.mjs","runtime/package.json","runtime/src/cli.mjs","runtime/src/clients.mjs","runtime/src/runtime.mjs","runtime/test/runtime.test.mjs"],"body":"2.2+2.3: AI-gateway og agent-runtime\n\n2.2 AI-gateway:\n- gateway/: routing pr. agent, budget (tokens/cost), modelversionering, OpenAI-agtig API\n- agent uden route kan ikke nå en model (403); direkte leverandørkald forbudt\n- contracts/gateway-route.schema.json + conformance A-003; 7 tests\n\n2.3 Agent-runtime:\n- runtime/: SPIFFE-identitet, JIT-credentials med TTL, kun deklarerede verber\n- spoerger PDP foer hver handling; doedemandsgreb ved utilgaengelig PDP/audit-log\n- A4-vaern (policy/audit/rettigheder), budgetter, loop-detektion, eskalering\n- contracts/agent-task.schema.json; 10 tests\n\ndocs: ai-gateway, agent-runtime, ADR-0006; README + indeks opdateret\nSigned-off-by: Martin <mooseofdoom@gmail.com>"}
